  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You shift constantly around your opponent and can climb like a monkey.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Monkey Moves<sup>UC</sup>.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While using Monkey Style, you can spend a swift action or one use of your mythic power to take a 5-foot step, even if you have moved this round, whenever you hit an opponent with your unarmed strike. In addition, while using Monkey Style, you can spend one use of your mythic power to gain a climb speed of half your normal land speed for as long as you continue using that style, up to 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc228\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
